{"results":[{"url":"https://houssed.com/mumbai/parinee-realty/parinee-essence-676","title":"Parinee Essence, Kandivali West, Mumbai | 2 & 3 BHK Premium Apartments | Houssed","raw_content":"[![Houssed](/assets/images/houssed_logo.svg)](/)\n\n[![whatsapp](/assets/images/whatsapp.svg)Connect Now](https://api.whatsapp.com/send/?phone=918169114718&text=Hi%2C+I%27m+looking+to+Buy+a+residential+property+in+Mumbai.+Please+connect+with+me.+Thanks%21&type=phone_number&app_absent=0)\n\n![Project Image of Parinee Essence in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 21471](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/676/Project%20Image/676_1678021247_be254ee04bb6107d52d63b7e79da81b8.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Amenities of Parinee Essence in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 21472](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/676/Amenities/676_1678021247_089f1ab182840962d324c0725c051597.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Sample Apartment of Parinee Essence in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 21473](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/676/Sample%20Apartment/676_1678021247_ce1aceb2a744fe5736de59c56e775be2.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Sample Apartment of Parinee Essence in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 21474](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/676/Sample%20Apartment/676_1678021247_986d19c3d873697045f0874cb9835c92.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n![Location of Parinee Essence in Kandivali West, Mumbai - Image 21475](https://imgcdn.houssed.com/assets/Files/Projects/676/Location/676_1678021247_c43f522cc74ae4a27f0cb76de5fc7418.webp)\n\nReady to Move  Premium\n\n## Project Overview of Parinee Essence Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n---\n\nNo. of Units\n\n289 Units\n\nProject Area\n\n1.4 Acres\n\nTowers / Floors\n\n1 Towers / 23 Floors\n\nProperty View\n\nOpen View\n\nParking\n\nTwo Wheeler, Four Wheeler\n\n---\n\nStyle your existence in the most magnificent homes at Parinee's Essence. A home for a select few, privileged to experience luxury, style and