nt interior finishes.\n* Lifestyle amenities designed for comfort & leisure.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-secondary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Intercom-Facility-secondary.svg)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/cctv-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-primary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/gym-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/gym-primary.svg)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![amenities/Intercom-Facility-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/Intercom-Facility-primary.svg)\n\nIntercom Facility\n\n![amenities/jogging-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-primary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-primary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-primary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-primary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n## Price & Floor Plan\n\n1 BHK\n\n2 BHK\n\n* ## 420 sq. ft\n* ## 444 sq. ft\n\nName\n\n1 BHK\n\nPrice Range\n\n₹84.58 L\n\n![Floor_Plan_Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/properties/parinee-developers-parinee-essence-1-bhk-bedroom-1672809349.webp)\n\n## Locality\n\n![hospital-primary](/assets/icons/hospital-primary.svg)\n\nhospital\n\n![school-secondary](/assets/icons/school-secondary.svg)\n\nschool\n\n![bank-secondary](/assets/icons/bank-secondary.svg)\n\nbank\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nYashasvi Hospital\n\n0.4 km\n\n![pdp-hospital](/assets/icons/pdp-hospital.svg)\n\nOsc