en for senior citizens, State-of-the-art Gymnasium, Intercom facility in each apartment, Meditation centre for all age groups, Main door lock with exclusive owner’s key. Ready possession.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹40,000**\n\n44% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Kandivali West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹25,373/sqft\n\nmedian · 34 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹75.8/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹60,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.6%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹22,391/sqft** — **12% below** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2020\n\nRevised\n\nDec 2020\n\nStatus\n\nOngoing\n\n02\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\nConfigurationCarpetIndicative Price\n\n1 RK269–290 ft²₹60 L–₹65 L\n\n1 BHK338–444 ft²₹76 L–₹99 L\n\n2 BHK554–705 ft²₹1.24 Cr–₹1.58 Cr\n\n3 BHK608–744 ft²₹1.36 Cr–₹1.67 Cr\n\nConfigurations & carpet per MahaRERA filing · indicative price = locality rate × carpet (not the developer's quote).\n\n[💬 Verify current inventory with an advisor](https://wa.me/919820067525?text=I%20am%20looking%20to%20buy%20a%20home%20in%20Project%20Parinee%20Essence%20(RERA%20P51800001334))\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nP51800001334\n\nRegistered\n\n2020-06-10\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\nHDFC BANK\n\nArchitect\n\nDharmesh Chevli\n\nTotal FSI\n\n17773\n\n04\n\n## Buildings · 1 Wing(s)\n\nParinee Essence24 floors · — units\n\n05\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n**Redevelopment / SRA / MHADA / MMRDA / Freehold** — provenance from MPE's verification layer. The genesis no portal shows.\n\n06\n\n## Location\n\n📍 Borivali  \n19.205434196297396,72.823909677315440\n\n▸ Explore map & Street View — for verified buyers\n\n07\n\n## Promoter & Professionals\n\nParinee Contour Construction Private LimitedNA\n\n08\n\n## Availability & Pricing\n\nTypeCarpetPriceAvail\n\n1 BHK420 ft²₹94 Lac—