ance. Connectivity is extremely effortless thanks to the Western Express Highway, S.V. Road and the Kandivali Railway Station.\n\nThere are numerous healthcare facilities, educational institutions and shopping complexes that are in the vicinity to ensure a comfortable living:\n\n**Healthcare Facilities:**\n\n* Zenith Hospital\n* Mangal Murti Hospital\n\n**Educational Institutions:**\n\n* Atharva College of Engineering\n* Ryan International School\n* Billabong International School\n* Don Bosco High School\n\n**Shopping Complexes:**\n\n* Infinity Mall\n* Oberoi Mall\n* Inorbit Mall\n\n**Sports Club**\n\n* Sachin Tendulkar Club\n* Goregaon Sports Club\n\nKandivali is a rapidly developing area in Mumbai that has observed a surge in real estate investments in recent years. It is well-connected to the rest of the city and other suburbs and offers a range of residential and commercial properties at relatively affordable prices. Additionally, the area has seen significant infrastructural development, with improved road connectivity, upcoming metro projects, and other amenities being added. Thanks to the Western Express Highway, the connectivity to prominent business districts such as Vikhroli, Goregaon and BKC is seamless. This is one of the many reasons why Kandivali is a popular residential market. This is why the future of real estate investments is looking bright in Kandivali.\n\n![about](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/635a319a831fdd6844dbdb57/450af06c-085c-4238-a20f-91662c0deff1_elevationparinee.png)\n\n---\n\n##### Properties\n\n* Similar Properties\n* Nearby Properties\n* More properties by Parinee Realty\n\n[![Sandhya Charkop Jeevan Mangal-IndexTap](https://indextap.s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/images/complex/646def1ada245958afa7cedf/c4c7f3c9-bbb9-4f3b-95c1-9b6a2a3bd908_elevationmangal.png)\n\n#### Sandhya Charkop Jeevan Mangal\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n1 & 2 BHK Flats\n\n73 L-1.0 Cr](/properties/details/sandhya-kshitij-builders/kandiv