## Edit Specification for Parinee Essence - Kandivali West - Mumbai\n\n### Overview\n\n### Units Details and Floor Plans\n\n| Configuration Type | Carpet Area (sq ft) | Base Price (Rs.) | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n\n### Home Loans\n\n![](../../Imageserverweb/dropdown-icon.svg)\n\n### Amenities\n\n![](../../Imageserverweb/dropdown-icon.svg)\n\n### Location and Highlights\n\n| LandMark | Distance (km) | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n## Location and Highlights\n\n![](/images/realestatemap.jpg)\n\nCharkop Industrial Estate, Near Ganesh Nagar, Babrekar Nagar Road, Charkop, Kandivali, Mumbai 400095, MH\n\n## Reviews on Parinee Essence, Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\nThis project is delayed by 2 years. Try to evade with lies when confronted for accountability and compensation of loss due to delay. This delay seems to be deliberate just in case market has a uptick, as declared on RERA website still have 50+ units unsold.\n\n![](../APP_THEMES/images/review/flag.svg)\n![](../../Images/COMMON/loading_ajax.gif)\n![](/Images/like-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/comment-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/share.png)\n\nView more comments\n\nThis building is in kandivali.\n\nKandivali is in mumbai Maharashtra.\n\nKandivali is a famous area of Mumbai Maharashtra.\n\nPer flat price is very costly but as a area vise that is normally and good.\n\n![](../APP_THEMES/images/review/flag.svg)\n![](../../Images/COMMON/loading_ajax.gif)\n![](/Images/like-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/comment-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/share.png)\n\nView more comments\n\nMy friend had taken a flat in it so I stayed there for 2days.those 2 days I had a very beautiful experience.there are so many luxury facilities out there.all modern amenities club house, reserved parking, swimming pool, intercom phone, gym, jogging track, power backup lift, security, etc.\n\n![](../APP_THEMES/images/review/flag.svg)\n![](../../Images/COMMON/loading_ajax.gif)\n![](/Images/like-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/comment-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/share.png)\n\nView more comments\n\nYOUR RATING ON\n\nYour Building Are Very Beautiful Very Nice Expresion & Your Serice Awesome Over All Very Good My Opinion Are Good im Going To Mumbai\n\n![](../APP_THEMES/images/review/flag.svg)\n![](../../Images/COMMON/loading_ajax.gif)\n![](/Images/like-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/comment-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/share.png)\n\nView more comments\n\nThis construction was very beautiful .after fulfil all the construction program then this building is look like excellent .after some time this building will looklike very beautiful. I think this is a very beautiful building or hotel in our country .\n\n![](../APP_THEMES/images/review/flag.svg)\n![](../../Images/COMMON/loading_ajax.gif)\n![](/Images/like-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/comment-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/share.png)\n\nView more comments\n\nThis hotal is wonderful and services is so good its everything is ok in this hotel and so lovely\n\nServices is very good and wonderful\n\n![](../APP_THEMES/images/review/flag.svg)\n![](../../Images/COMMON/loading_ajax.gif)\n![](/Images/like-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/comment-icon.svg)\n![](/Images/share.png)\n\nView more comments\n\n## Parinee Essence, Kandivali West, Mumbai Photos\n\n![](../../APP_THEMES/images/category/Close - Dark.svg)\n![](../../APP_THEMES/images/category/Close - Dark.svg)\n![Real Estate Banner](/Images/Real_Estate_Footer_Banner_Icon.png)\n\n### MouthShut is the best platform to start your real estate search!\n\n### Real Estate Brands\n\n### Real Estate Builders under Mumbai\n\n### Real Estate Projects under Mumbai\n\nProducts Listed\n\nShopping Decisions Influenced\n\n### MouthShut for Brands\n\n### Review of the Day\n\n![Verified Member](/APP_THEMES/Default/IMAGES/verified-member-icon.png)\n\n### India's No.1 Rating & Review App\n\nDownload MouthShut Mobile App\n\n![](../../../ImageServerWeb/new home page icons/App.svg)\n![](/APP_THEMES/Images_New/Common/app-store-badge.svg)\n![](../../../ImageServerWeb/new home page icons/Play-Google.svg)\n![](/APP_TH